#   #       unlock
#   #       dialogue
#   #       reward_item
#   #
#   #   Update previous_rule_id / current_rule_id
#   #
#   #   Track rule_conflicts (multiple rules firing on same tick)
#
#   # Optionally call score_with_cartigene(f, metrics_out)
#
#   Return updated sierra_state.
